Third-party: Middleware/vqf-c/
================================
Vendored from https://github.com/DusKing1/vqf-c (MIT License)
Copyright (c) 2024 Hugo Chiang

Full VQF C port of the algorithm by Daniel Laidig and Thomas Seel:
  https://github.com/dlaidig/vqf
  D. Laidig and T. Seel, "VQF: Highly Accurate IMU Orientation Estimation
  with Bias Estimation and Magnetic Disturbance Rejection," Information
  Fusion, 2023. doi:10.1016/j.inffus.2022.10.014

Files: vqf.c, vqf.h, LICENSE (upstream), README.upstream.md

Local adaptations in this tree:
  - initVqf() calls init_params() (upstream omitted this; params would stay BSS-zero)
  - added #include <string.h> / <stddef.h> for memcpy / size_t
  - define cos_fast/sin_fast/tan_fast → cosf/sinf/tanf (upstream undeclared)
  - remove OOB resetState loop writing 18 into restLastGyrLp[3]
  - restLastSquaredDeviations fill count 3→2 (array is [2])

Do not call updateMag() in 6DOF-only builds; pass a large magTs (e.g. 5.0f)
to initVqf as shown in the upstream README.
